        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86271, Cabinet Trail Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Trail Cabinet Knob is from Emtek's contemporary collection. This modern cabinet knob is available in a wide array of finish colors. It comes packaged with the installation hardware. The Trail Knob can be used as a furniture pull and also in the bathroom on the vanity.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86271-specifications.gif?v=1704354746\" width=\"600\" height=\"183\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86271 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/trail-refrigerator-handle-emtek-ap-86440\"><b>Trail Appliance Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/trail-cabinet-pull-emtek-86161\"><b>Trail Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Trail Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 3/8\" x 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
